  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep sweet potato: Preheat the air fryer to 200C (see Don't have an air fryer?). Line the air-fryer basket with foil. Cut the unpeeled sweet potatoes into 2cm-thick wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218899/photos/large/362519_1-8158fcf9a89688f5d7cbbb3a5f56de86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Air-fry wedges: Generously spray the sweet potato wedges with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Put in the lined air-fryer basket. Air-fry for 15 mins or until golden and tender. Dot half the cream cheese over the wedges, then cook for a further 2 mins or until the cream cheese is softened.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218904/photos/large/362519_2-850f5fbc8cd6dd7c50e02cbe4a9f9753.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prep tomato: Meanwhile, coarsely chop the tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218909/photos/large/362519_3-2c58eb29d3998115e8ac9b804a063ea5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss salad: Combine the tomato, salad leaves and vinaigrette in a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218911/photos/large/362519_4-67748553711fa9d215a8955141720ff9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the cheesy wedges among plates. Drizzle over the sweet chilli sauce and scatter with the sunflower seeds. Serve with the salad and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218918/photos/large/362519_5-5ee6b0c70f3ef80250ea13bfc891742f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't have an air fryer?: No worries, you can cook the wedges in the oven. Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Put the sweet potato wedges on a lined oven tray and bake for 28-30 mins until golden and tender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4218921/photos/large/362519_6-6008943387a372362a097cc2b5e7fe2e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
